{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "开播前那几分钟，你一般怎么热嗓子？", "t0": 678814.659253, "t1": 678819.487623, "dur_ms": 4828.37, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:15:40", "llm_end": 678819.416845, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.32], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.3], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.32], ["s5_infer", 4778.27], ["s6_guard", 4779.08], ["s7_save_wav", 4784.65], ["s8_write_cache", 4803.42], ["s9_vram", 4804.89], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4804.91], ["l2_named_copy", 4826.37], ["l3_progress_cb", 4828.37]], "audio_ms": 4240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "先喝口温水，别太烫，然后轻声哼一段。", "t0": 678819.507838, "t1": 678825.143617, "dur_ms": 5635.78, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:15:46", "llm_end": 678825.07284, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.12], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.6], ["s3_tmpdir", 23.05], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 23.09], ["s5_infer", 5586.22], ["s6_guard", 5586.85], ["s7_save_wav", 5591.88], ["s8_write_cache", 5610.69], ["s9_vram", 5611.62], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5611.63], ["l2_named_copy", 5634.28], ["l3_progress_cb", 5635.78]], "audio_ms": 5040, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "哼鸣啊，我以为是直接念稿子开嗓。", "t0": 678825.165124, "t1": 678830.694229, "dur_ms": 5529.1, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:15:51", "llm_end": 678830.620501, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.12], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.14], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.44], ["s3_tmpdir", 21.06], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 21.11], ["s5_infer", 5476.89], ["s6_guard", 5477.54], ["s7_save_wav", 5485.7], ["s8_write_cache", 5505.08], ["s9_vram", 5505.87], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5505.89], ["l2_named_copy", 5527.7], ["l3_progress_cb", 5529.1]], "audio_ms": 5080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "B", "chars": 19, "text": "直接念容易紧，哼鸣能让声带慢慢活动开。", "t0": 678830.714569, "t1": 678838.281434, "dur_ms": 7566.87, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:15:59", "llm_end": 678838.208653, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.47], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.39], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.44], ["s5_infer", 7516.16], ["s6_guard", 7516.87], ["s7_save_wav", 7521.39], ["s8_write_cache", 7542.04], ["s9_vram", 7542.95], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 7542.97], ["l2_named_copy", 7565.38], ["l3_progress_cb", 7566.86]], "audio_ms": 7000, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "A", "chars": 18, "text": "那音量呢，一开始就要放到正常大小吗？", "t0": 678838.301498, "t1": 678842.981443, "dur_ms": 4679.94, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:16:04", "llm_end": 678842.909624, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.65], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.58], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.62], ["s5_infer", 4629.95], ["s6_guard", 4630.64], ["s7_save_wav", 4635.45], ["s8_write_cache", 4654.96], ["s9_vram", 4655.64], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4655.66], ["l2_named_copy", 4678.49], ["l3_progress_cb", 4679.94]], "audio_ms": 3920, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "B", "chars": 19, "text": "不用，从小声一点点加上去，三分钟就够。", "t0": 678843.004541, "t1": 678865.734215, "dur_ms": 22729.67, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:16:26", "llm_end": 678865.659557, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.31], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.55], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.59], ["s5_infer", 15482.59], ["s6_guard", 22676.71], ["s7_save_wav", 22685.67], ["s8_write_cache", 22704.76], ["s9_vram", 22705.44], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 22705.45], ["l2_named_copy", 22728.22], ["l3_progress_cb", 22729.67]], "audio_ms": 6840, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "明白了，先温水再哼鸣，最后慢慢加音量。", "t0": 678865.753957, "t1": 678870.928151, "dur_ms": 5174.19, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:16:31", "llm_end": 678870.854367, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.48], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.48], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.52], ["s5_infer", 5121.63], ["s6_guard", 5122.29], ["s7_save_wav", 5130.5], ["s8_write_cache", 5149.71], ["s9_vram", 5150.64], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5150.66], ["l2_named_copy", 5172.85], ["l3_progress_cb", 5174.19]], "audio_ms": 4680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "对，别硬喊，舒服了再正式开口最稳。", "t0": 678870.949196, "t1": 678877.453323, "dur_ms": 6504.13, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:16:38", "llm_end": 678877.378231, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.28], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.11], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.15], ["s5_infer", 6452.3], ["s6_guard", 6452.91], ["s7_save_wav", 6461.32], ["s8_write_cache", 6480.61], ["s9_vram", 6481.39], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6481.41], ["l2_named_copy", 6502.75], ["l3_progress_cb", 6504.12]], "audio_ms": 6080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 21, "text": "今天聊聊睡眠，为什么说它是最好的恢复方式？", "t0": 678898.375272, "t1": 678903.563661, "dur_ms": 5188.39, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:04", "llm_end": 678903.48888, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.85], ["s3_tmpdir", 2.02], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 2.06], ["s5_infer", 5134.32], ["s6_guard", 5135.16], ["s7_save_wav", 5143.02], ["s8_write_cache", 5162.5], ["s9_vram", 5163.39], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5163.4], ["l2_named_copy", 5186.46], ["l3_progress_cb", 5188.38]], "audio_ms": 4680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 20, "text": "因为睡眠不是关机，而是身体在集中做维修。", "t0": 678903.584635, "t1": 678909.26791, "dur_ms": 5683.27, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:10", "llm_end": 678909.196265, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.52], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.45], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.49], ["s5_infer", 5633.28], ["s6_guard", 5634.02], ["s7_save_wav", 5640.4], ["s8_write_cache", 5657.52], ["s9_vram", 5658.16], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5658.17], ["l2_named_copy", 5681.68], ["l3_progress_cb", 5683.27]], "audio_ms": 5160, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "维修这个说法挺形象，具体修什么呢？", "t0": 678909.288919, "t1": 678914.825456, "dur_ms": 5536.54, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:15", "llm_end": 678914.754076, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.56], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.81], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.85], ["s5_infer", 5487.51], ["s6_guard", 5488.15], ["s7_save_wav", 5496.6], ["s8_write_cache", 5512.0], ["s9_vram", 5512.63], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5512.65], ["l2_named_copy", 5535.12], ["l3_progress_cb", 5536.53]], "audio_ms": 5000, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "B", "chars": 21, "text": "先说大脑，深睡时脑内清理废物的效率会提高。", "t0": 678914.845755, "t1": 678922.346974, "dur_ms": 7501.22, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:23", "llm_end": 678922.27172, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.42], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.55], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.58], ["s5_infer", 7448.04], ["s6_guard", 7448.73], ["s7_save_wav", 7457.33], ["s8_write_cache", 7476.0], ["s9_vram", 7476.65], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 7476.67], ["l2_named_copy", 7499.39], ["l3_progress_cb", 7501.22]], "audio_ms": 6960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "就像夜里打扫，把白天积的垃圾运走。", "t0": 678922.367529, "t1": 678927.046324, "dur_ms": 4678.8, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:28", "llm_end": 678926.973293, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.49], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.72], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.76], ["s5_infer", 4627.89], ["s6_guard", 4628.74], ["s7_save_wav", 4633.01], ["s8_write_cache", 4652.96], ["s9_vram", 4653.73], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4653.75], ["l2_named_copy", 4677.35], ["l3_progress_cb", 4678.79]], "audio_ms": 3880, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "对，所以睡不够，第二天脑子会发木。", "t0": 678927.066752, "t1": 678932.283056, "dur_ms": 5216.3, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:33", "llm_end": 678932.207714, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.58], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.65], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.7], ["s5_infer", 5163.76], ["s6_guard", 5164.37], ["s7_save_wav", 5172.67], ["s8_write_cache", 5192.06], ["s9_vram", 5192.76], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5192.77], ["l2_named_copy", 5214.82], ["l3_progress_cb", 5216.3]], "audio_ms": 4680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "除了大脑，身体其他部分也在修吗？", "t0": 678932.304602, "t1": 678937.19627, "dur_ms": 4891.67, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:38", "llm_end": 678937.120135, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.58], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.8], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.85], ["s5_infer", 4837.04], ["s6_guard", 4837.8], ["s7_save_wav", 4846.14], ["s8_write_cache", 4866.25], ["s9_vram", 4866.9], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4866.92], ["l2_named_copy", 4889.9], ["l3_progress_cb", 4891.66]], "audio_ms": 4320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "B", "chars": 21, "text": "肌肉修复和免疫调节，很多都集中在深睡阶段。", "t0": 678937.216434, "t1": 678943.081719, "dur_ms": 5865.28, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:44", "llm_end": 678943.008094, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.48], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.42], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.47], ["s5_infer", 5815.35], ["s6_guard", 5816.08], ["s7_save_wav", 5820.6], ["s8_write_cache", 5839.93], ["s9_vram", 5840.61], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5840.63], ["l2_named_copy", 5863.66], ["l3_progress_cb", 5865.28]], "audio_ms": 5360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 9, "speaker": "A", "chars": 15, "text": "那运动之后睡一觉，恢复会更快？", "t0": 678943.102038, "t1": 678947.462834, "dur_ms": 4360.8, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:48", "llm_end": 678947.38507, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.66], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.8], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.85], ["s5_infer", 4304.3], ["s6_guard", 4304.9], ["s7_save_wav", 4310.15], ["s8_write_cache", 4332.77], ["s9_vram", 4333.45], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4333.47], ["l2_named_copy", 4359.31], ["l3_progress_cb", 4360.79]], "audio_ms": 3680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 10, "speaker": "B", "chars": 21, "text": "据我了解，睡眠充足时肌肉酸痛会缓解得更顺。", "t0": 678947.48437, "t1": 678953.071526, "dur_ms": 5587.16, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:54", "llm_end": 678952.999867, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.63], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.5], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.54], ["s5_infer", 5538.01], ["s6_guard", 5538.96], ["s7_save_wav", 5543.23], ["s8_write_cache", 5563.07], ["s9_vram", 5563.76], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5563.78], ["l2_named_copy", 5585.76], ["l3_progress_cb", 5587.15]], "audio_ms": 5080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 11, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "情绪这块呢，睡不好人特别容易烦躁。", "t0": 678953.091683, "t1": 678958.153461, "dur_ms": 5061.78, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:17:59", "llm_end": 678958.081961, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.53], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.53], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.56], ["s5_infer", 5010.98], ["s6_guard", 5011.61], ["s7_save_wav", 5016.54], ["s8_write_cache", 5036.57], ["s9_vram", 5037.3], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5037.32], ["l2_named_copy", 5060.2], ["l3_progress_cb", 5061.77]], "audio_ms": 4520, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 12, "speaker": "B", "chars": 19, "text": "睡眠帮大脑整理记忆，也帮情绪重新归位。", "t0": 678958.173679, "t1": 678963.769281, "dur_ms": 5595.6, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:18:04", "llm_end": 678963.698684, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.67], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.79], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.83], ["s5_infer", 5545.44], ["s6_guard", 5546.09], ["s7_save_wav", 5551.35], ["s8_write_cache", 5571.14], ["s9_vram", 5572.21], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5572.23], ["l2_named_copy", 5594.11], ["l3_progress_cb", 5595.6]], "audio_ms": 4920, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 13, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "所以熬夜补觉，其实补不回来？", "t0": 678963.789926, "t1": 678968.558146, "dur_ms": 4768.22, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:18:09", "llm_end": 678968.484404, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.62], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.78], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.83], ["s5_infer", 4715.92], ["s6_guard", 4716.55], ["s7_save_wav", 4724.7], ["s8_write_cache", 4743.7], ["s9_vram", 4744.43], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4744.44], ["l2_named_copy", 4766.8], ["l3_progress_cb", 4768.22]], "audio_ms": 4240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 14, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "补觉能缓解，但规律作息的效果更稳。", "t0": 678968.578183, "t1": 678974.452226, "dur_ms": 5874.04, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:18:15", "llm_end": 678974.375385, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.48], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.29], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.32], ["s5_infer", 5819.2], ["s6_guard", 5819.87], ["s7_save_wav", 5827.77], ["s8_write_cache", 5848.63], ["s9_vram", 5849.42], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5849.44], ["l2_named_copy", 5872.6], ["l3_progress_cb", 5874.04]], "audio_ms": 5320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 15, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "那睡多久算够，是不是一定要八小时？", "t0": 678974.473689, "t1": 678978.279445, "dur_ms": 3805.76, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:18:19", "llm_end": 678978.210228, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.57], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.41], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.45], ["s5_infer", 3756.45], ["s6_guard", 3757.21], ["s7_save_wav", 3762.54], ["s8_write_cache", 3781.9], ["s9_vram", 3782.54], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3782.56], ["l2_named_copy", 3804.36], ["l3_progress_cb", 3805.75]], "audio_ms": 3080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 16, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "有人七小时精神很好，有人需要九小时。", "t0": 678978.301007, "t1": 678983.20606, "dur_ms": 4905.05, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:18:24", "llm_end": 678983.130434, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.17], ["s0_enter", 0.18], ["s1_load", 0.19], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.67], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.87], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.92], ["s5_infer", 4851.33], ["s6_guard", 4852.02], ["s7_save_wav", 4855.87], ["s8_write_cache", 4877.04], ["s9_vram", 4877.7], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4877.72], ["l2_named_copy", 4903.54], ["l3_progress_cb", 4905.05]], "audio_ms": 4320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 17, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "所以关键还是看白天清不清醒。", "t0": 678983.22705, "t1": 678987.9564, "dur_ms": 4729.35, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:18:28", "llm_end": 678987.884374, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.64], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.66], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.7], ["s5_infer", 4679.7], ["s6_guard", 4680.41], ["s7_save_wav", 4688.65], ["s8_write_cache", 4705.05], ["s9_vram", 4705.68], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4705.7], ["l2_named_copy", 4727.83], ["l3_progress_cb", 4729.35]], "audio_ms": 4160, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 18, "speaker": "B", "chars": 14, "text": "想睡好，有什么常识性的做法？", "t0": 678987.9767, "t1": 678993.38001, "dur_ms": 5403.31, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:18:34", "llm_end": 678993.308364, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.38], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.37], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.41], ["s5_infer", 5352.3], ["s6_guard", 5353.13], ["s7_save_wav", 5357.33], ["s8_write_cache", 5377.25], ["s9_vram", 5378.05], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5378.06], ["l2_named_copy", 5401.76], ["l3_progress_cb", 5403.31]], "audio_ms": 4720, "cached": false, "ok": true}
